OL,3,GNEWSAResidents asked to help track down
OL,4,Afly-tippers
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being asked to help a
OL,7,Fcouncil catch criminals who fly-tip
OL,8,Frubbish in an area "blighted" by the
OL,9,Fproblem.
OL,11,FWest Northamptonshire Council recorded
OL,12,F22,769 incidents of fly-tipping in the
OL,13,Fpast year, compared with just more than
OL,14,F17,000 in the 2023-24 period.
OL,16,FThis was a slight improvement on the
OL,17,F2024-25 period, when waste was
OL,18,Fillegally dumped 22,923 times.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
